  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25616816",
      "title": "The \"_app.js\" File & Layout Wrapper",
      "sourceHash": "c8e5bf9f8eea181026912a4de30a5da43d22b394d47bb33efd21f48572466805",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.83,
          "en": "Now I did prepare some components here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.83,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "in the layout folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 9.01,
          "en": "in the Components folder that give our pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.01,
          "end": 13.13,
          "en": "a general layout and also a main navigation bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.13,
          "end": 17.033,
          "en": "which holds some links, some list items with links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.9,
          "end": 19.68,
          "en": "We just need to use that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.68,
          "end": 21.69,
          "en": "Now this layout component is built such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.69,
          "end": 24.46,
          "en": "that we can wrap it around other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.46,
          "end": 27.09,
          "en": "so that we can wrap it around our content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.09,
          "end": 30.32,
          "en": "that should be framed by that layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.32,
          "end": 34,
          "en": "because layout, this component uses props children",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34,
          "end": 37.69,
          "en": "to take what's between the opening and closing layout text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.69,
          "end": 40.933,
          "en": "and wrap this component around that content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 43.73,
          "en": "That means that we can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.73,
          "end": 45.5,
          "en": "go to the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.5,
          "end": 47.82,
          "en": "so in NextJS and the Pages folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.82,
          "end": 51.52,
          "en": "and we can wrap meetup list with layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.52,
          "end": 54.37,
          "en": "Now for this, we also need to import layout, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.37,
          "end": 57.49,
          "en": "So we import layout from going up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.49,
          "end": 61.18,
          "en": "components, layout, layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.18,
          "end": 63.22,
          "en": "We can add this import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.22,
          "end": 64.81,
          "en": "and once this import was added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.81,
          "end": 68.57300000000001,
          "en": "we can wrap layout around meetup lists like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.53,
          "end": 72.62,
          "en": "And if we do that and save this, we get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.62,
          "end": 74.78,
          "en": "that link is not defined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.78,
          "end": 76.5,
          "en": "Now we get this error because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.5,
          "end": 78.82,
          "en": "in that main navigation component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.82,
          "end": 80.3,
          "en": "I'm using the link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.3,
          "end": 82.83,
          "en": "but I'm not importing it deliberately",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.83,
          "end": 85.76,
          "en": "because I wanted to do this together with you again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.76,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "We learned about this link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 92.06,
          "en": "and we import it from next/link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.06,
          "end": 94.36,
          "en": "And that allows us to create those links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.36,
          "end": 96.63,
          "en": "However, the two prop then should be changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.63,
          "end": 99.50999999999999,
          "en": "to ref because the link component offered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.50999999999999,
          "end": 103.09,
          "en": "by NextJS wants this ref prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.09,
          "end": 106.78999999999999,
          "en": "where we define the destination of that link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.78999999999999,
          "end": 109.99000000000001,
          "en": "But with that changed and with that link import added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.99000000000001,
          "end": 112.97999999999999,
          "en": "if we now save everything and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.97999999999999,
          "end": 116.42,
          "en": "we got this nice navigation bar at the top here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.42,
          "end": 118.63,
          "en": "and we've got a white border around that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.63,
          "end": 120.7,
          "en": "for that go into your global styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.7,
          "end": 124.11,
          "en": "and here in body, set margin to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.11,
          "end": 126.592,
          "en": "That's something I forgot for the starting project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.592,
          "end": 131.11,
          "en": "But if we add margin zero to body in the global CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.11,
          "end": 132.74,
          "en": "then this white border is gone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.74,
          "end": 134.54,
          "en": "and now we got this frame here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.58,
          "end": 138.31,
          "en": "and now we can also click all meetups to go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.31,
          "end": 141.37,
          "en": "to this starting page and click add new meetup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.37,
          "end": 143.32999999999998,
          "en": "to go to this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.32999999999998,
          "end": 145.562,
          "en": "On this page, we are, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.562,
          "end": 146.45,
          "en": "still missing the layout though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.45,
          "end": 148.3,
          "en": "We only have it on the starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 153.27,
          "en": "Now we want to have it on this new meetup page as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.27,
          "end": 154.3,
          "en": "and therefore, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.3,
          "end": 157.3,
          "en": "we can always wrap layout around our content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.3,
          "end": 160.9,
          "en": "on the new meetup page to add the layout here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.9,
          "end": 164.5,
          "en": "But you will probably see that, this becomes cumbersome,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 164.5,
          "end": 167.45,
          "en": "the more pages our application has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.45,
          "end": 169.57999999999998,
          "en": "If we have an application with dozens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 169.57999999999998,
          "end": 173.78,
          "en": "or maybe hundreds of pages wrapping our general layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.78,
          "end": 176.37,
          "en": "around all the page contents,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 179.56,
          "en": "so going into all the page components to then wrap layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 179.56,
          "end": 182.87,
          "en": "around the content that becomes cumbersome,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 182.87,
          "end": 187.55,
          "en": "and that's now where this _app.js file becomes important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 187.55,
          "end": 190.08,
          "en": "This is a special file, which exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.08,
          "end": 192.02,
          "en": "in this Pages folder out of the box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.02,
          "end": 193.83,
          "en": "at which you could create on your own as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 193.83,
          "end": 196.62,
          "en": "if it doesn't exist in which should contain content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.62,
          "end": 197.8,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.8,
          "end": 200.76,
          "en": "This is kind of your route component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.76,
          "end": 203.049,
          "en": "This MyApp component, which is defined in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.049,
          "end": 207.2,
          "en": "and that is just a regular react component in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.2,
          "end": 210.6,
          "en": "This special component acts as the root component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.6,
          "end": 212.353,
          "en": "NextJS will render.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213.23,
          "end": 216.79,
          "en": "It receives props and uses object de-structuring here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.79,
          "end": 219.32999999999998,
          "en": "to pull information out of the props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.32999999999998,
          "end": 221.59,
          "en": "and the information it pulls out there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.59,
          "end": 224.89,
          "en": "is a component prop and a page prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 224.89,
          "end": 226.82999999999998,
          "en": "These props are passed into this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.82999999999998,
          "end": 230.28,
          "en": "MyApp component automatically by NextJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 230.28,
          "end": 235.28,
          "en": "since NextJS is the thing using that specific component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.41,
          "end": 239.12,
          "en": "and component is a prop that holds the actual page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 239.12,
          "end": 241.03,
          "en": "contents that should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.03,
          "end": 242.07,
          "en": "So it will be different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 246.37,
          "en": "whenever we switch a page and page props are specific props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246.37,
          "end": 248.54,
          "en": "our pages might be getting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 248.54,
          "end": 250.58,
          "en": "and at the moment our pages are not getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 250.58,
          "end": 252.06,
          "en": "any props at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 252.06,
          "end": 254.82,
          "en": "because at the moment we have no source",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 254.82,
          "end": 256.95,
          "en": "that would provide such props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 256.95,
          "end": 259.87,
          "en": "but that is something we're going to change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 259.87,
          "end": 262.85,
          "en": "But with that, we now know that component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 262.85,
          "end": 265.7,
          "en": "in this _app.js file will in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 265.7,
          "end": 270.18,
          "en": "be the actual page content of our different pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 270.18,
          "end": 272.14,
          "en": "And it will change whenever we navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 272.14,
          "end": 273.973,
          "en": "from page A to page B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 275.07,
          "end": 276.94,
          "en": "Now, since that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 276.94,
          "end": 279.179,
          "en": "we can utilize this _app.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 279.179,
          "end": 282.07,
          "en": "and simply wrap this component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 282.07,
          "end": 285.82,
          "en": "with our layout or with whichever wrapper you have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 285.82,
          "end": 287.63,
          "en": "And we then don't have to do it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 287.63,
          "end": 290.87,
          "en": "inside of our different page files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 290.87,
          "end": 292.87,
          "en": "So we can remove the layout wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 292.87,
          "end": 295.39,
          "en": "from index.js here from our homepage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 295.39,
          "end": 297.6,
          "en": "we can remove that and go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 297.6,
          "end": 300.07,
          "en": "to just returning the meetup list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 300.07,
          "end": 302.17,
          "en": "and remove the layout import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 303.08,
          "end": 304.753,
          "en": "and instead go to _app.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 305.6,
          "end": 309.15,
          "en": "and then here, we import layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 309.15,
          "end": 313.53,
          "en": "from going up one level diving into components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 313.53,
          "end": 317.06,
          "en": "layout and then pointing at the layout file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 317.06,
          "end": 319.33,
          "en": "And we now wrap this component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 319.33,
          "end": 321.66,
          "en": "with the layout component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 321.66,
          "end": 324.37,
          "en": "And that means that our different page contents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 324.37,
          "end": 327.273,
          "en": "will be wrapped with this layout component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 328.21,
          "end": 330.22,
          "en": "And hence, if we now save all files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 330.22,
          "end": 333.97,
          "en": "with all those changes, now on the new meetup page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 333.97,
          "end": 336.11,
          "en": "we also got this layout applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 336.11,
          "end": 337.69,
          "en": "We got the navigation bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 337.69,
          "end": 340.05,
          "en": "we got the extra styling, which ensures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 340.05,
          "end": 343.85,
          "en": "that the page content does not take the entire width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 343.85,
          "end": 345.82,
          "en": "And hence now on all the pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 345.82,
          "end": 349.07,
          "en": "we got this layout and we don't need to wrap it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 349.07,
          "end": 351.022,
          "en": "around the different page contents inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 351.022,
          "end": 352.87,
          "en": "of the different page files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 352.87,
          "end": 354.87,
          "en": "And of course that therefore is the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 354.87,
          "end": 357.113,
          "en": "more maintainable and convenient approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 357.113,
          "end": 362.113,
          "en": "of applying general components to our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 362.29,
          "end": 364.15,
          "en": "So whenever you have some component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 364.15,
          "end": 367.6,
          "en": "or some setting that affects all your pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 367.6,
          "end": 371.53,
          "en": "you can utilize this _app.js file to easily add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 371.53,
          "end": 375.163,
          "en": "that without diving into dozens of files individually.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}